Type: Package
Package: equatags
Title: Convert, Measure and Draw 'LaTeX' Equations
Version: 0.4.0.001
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Gohel", , "david.gohel@ardata.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("ArData", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Transform 'LaTeX' math expressions into 'HTML' or
    'Office Open XML Math', to include them in 'HTML' pages, 'Microsoft
    Word' documents or 'Microsoft PowerPoint' presentations with a
    'Markdown' document or the R package 'officer'. Compute the size of
    equations and draw them with 'grid', with the rules of 'TeX' and the
    parameters of an 'OpenType' math font, independently of the graphic
    device.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ardata-fr/equatags
BugReports: https://github.com/ardata-fr/equatags/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: 
    gdtools (>= 0.6.0),
    grid,
    katex,
    systemfonts (>= 1.2.0),
    xml2,
    xslt
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
